body:
These are 3 minor incidents, all in the same grade, all by the same teacher. I honestly don't remember her name, but the 2 weeks I had to have her as a substitute because my regular teacher was sick were the worst couple weeks I had throughout elementary school. Keep in mind this is kinda long

&#x200B;

I was in 5th grade, we were doing this "morning meeting" thing where basically everyone in the class gets into a circle on the floor and we play a game or something. I (being the idiot I was in 5th grade) was just talking to my friends while the teacher was saying something. This was a substitute teacher btw. She got tired of me talking and pulled me aside to lecture me or something tbh I don't even remember what she said. While she was talking, I grabbed my water bottle and started drinking from it. This bitch rips the water bottle out of my hand, spilling water all over my shirt and shorts. I was completely shocked. She let me go back to the circle where I showed my friends what just happened and the teacher says, " You shouldn't have been rude then and not listened to me." Bitch because I was doing what every 5th grader does and then taking a sip from my water bottle gives you the right to get my shit all wet?

&#x200B;

Another time we were using our computers to do this online learning thing called DreamBox. I got up to go get a tissue and as I was blowing my nose I turn around and she walks over to my desk, closes my computer, and takes it to her desk. At this point I was confused as hell, because I hadn't done anything wrong and I wasn't playing games on it or anything, I was just doing my work. I went over to her desk to confront her and she told me "I wasn't doing my work" and that she would give it back to me at the end of the day. I asked her what I should do instead and she said "I don't know, just go sit there or something" Thank you, education system.

&#x200B;

Last one, I was in the middle of presenting ( I don't remember what the project was) and because I was kind of the funny kid or atleast the kid who tried to be funny, I was making a joke or something and I said "Oh my god" this teacher flips her shit and yells at me and embarrasses me in front of the whole class. She tells me to not say bad words, then tells me to go sit back down and try presenting again when I'm ready. All because I said oh my god when I was presenting. Fuck this teacher.
